<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    Monochrome mosque silhouette used as the notification small icon and as the
    adaptive-icon monochrome (themed icon) layer.

    Notification small icons are drawn using ONLY the alpha channel of the
    drawable (the system tints them), so this must remain a solid white shape
    on a fully transparent background. Do not replace it with the colorful
    app logo PNG (ic_app_icon.png) - an opaque bitmap renders as a blank
    white square in the status bar and notification shade.
-->
